## Why This Is Asked

This angle tests a practical streaming data structure that tracks per-item distinct-user counts within a moving window, using a combination of time-ordered storage, hash maps, and a heap for top-K queries. It emphasizes lazy expirations and correctness under high throughput.

## Key Concepts

